{"id":"vod_sn_37446","vodId":"37446","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"加速世界","name_cn":"加速世界","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ecdc132d32f7a5c22fa3320ea1e40463.jpg"},"summary":"现代社会之中，校园欺凌事件屡禁不止，成为学校和社会的难题。身材肥胖个性内向的有田春雪（梶裕贵 配音）便是长期欺凌的受害者。性格懦弱的春雪无法反抗欺凌者，唯有躲在网络之后，靠玩躲避球游戏来发泄愤怒。一来二去之间，春雪竟然成为了校园内躲避球游戏得分第一位。　　有着“黑雪公主”之称的学生会副会长黑雪姬（三泽纱千香 配音）出现在了春日的面前，黑雪姬不仅制止了对于春雪的欺凌，更邀请他进入了名为“Brain Buster”的方程式，在其中，春日化身成为拥有千倍思考速度的超频连线者，被卷入了激烈的战斗之中。黑雪姬召集春日等人的目的只有一个，那就是重组昔日“黑之王”的军团。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:29","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pkeJKQ3nkm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Vb8LnAUPsR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eFhJnLujw81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PNhZqhpwWS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jp6ziWng8n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h8e8s5eDji1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sAtPKbazbd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F6E5pENJpA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rzSmZAt7ZH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0uY8mGD9AA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/71YLFXYFEP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KXHzp6LnsK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2M0MZFbKrJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V9aUJBHJnZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url"